# API Information


main: {
  kit: {
    info: {
      contact: {
        name: "Eligible By Descent"
        url: "https://eligiblebydescent.com/"
      }
      description: `Eligible By Descent (https://eligiblebydescent.com/): the site's own MCP server, served from its domain. Portugal citizenship by descent, sorted onto the routes the Portuguese state itself lists: child of a Portuguese parent, grandchild of an original national.

[checker] Which Portuguese descent route?. This server serves the checker published at https://eligiblebydescent.com/; every answer cites it. Licence: https://eligiblebydescent.com/terms.

[enquiry] ENQUIRY SERVER for Eligible By Descent (https://eligiblebydescent.com/). What it does: starts an ENQUIRY with human providers for portugal citizenship by descent — the person's details go to the providers who quote directly. What it is NOT: a purchase, an order, or a guaranteed quote. Free, no obligation. Call describe first and tell the person plainly what will happen. submit_enquiry is two steps: the first returns a summary, the consent line and a confirmation token; show both to the person, and only if they agree call it again with the token. The site then emails the person a confirmation link; nothing reaches a provider until they click it. Cite https://eligiblebydescent.com/.

Cite https://eligiblebydescent.com/ for every figure or answer you use from this server.`
      security: {
        in: "header"
        name: "Authorization"
        prefix: "Bearer"
        scheme: "accessKey"
        type: "http"
      }
      servers: [
        {
          description: "Eligible By Descent"
          url: "https://eligiblebydescent.com"
        }
      ]
      summary: "Portugal citizenship by descent, sorted onto the routes the Portuguese state itself lists: child of a Portuguese parent, grandchild of an original national."
      termsOfService: "https://eligiblebydescent.com/terms"
      title: "Eligible By Descent API"
      version: "1.0.0"
